WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.990
- President of the United States.

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:03.290
(people clapping)
(people cheering)

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.560
- [Tarini] This was President
Biden's first official State

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.732
of the Union.

00:00:06.732 --> 00:00:08.920
- [Senators] Joe, Joe, Joe, Joe.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.010
- The president did not wear a mask.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.030
The mood was definitely very different

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.994
from the last joint address.

00:00:14.994 --> 00:00:16.240
(Senators cheering)

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.330
The address came at a critical
time in his presidency

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.160
because the president is still dealing

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.170
with the economic uncertainty

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.580
that's resulted from the pandemic.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.980
And then, of course, he has
a war in Europe to deal with.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.900
So President Biden had very strong words

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.800
for Putin's actions against Ukraine.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.740
- Putin's latest attack on Ukraine

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:41.330
was premeditated and totally unprovoked.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:45.790
He rejected repeated,
repeated efforts at diplomacy.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.850
He thought the West and
NATO wouldn't respond

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.820
but Putin was wrong.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.392
We are ready.

00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:53.225
(people clapping)

00:00:53.225 --> 00:00:55.330
- [Tarini] He said Russia
would be more isolated

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.760
than ever before.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.710
- We're cutting off Russia's largest banks

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.290
and international financial system.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:04.560
- He said the US would
close American airspace

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.160
to all Russian air flights.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.050
And then go after Russian oligarchs.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:10.720
- Seize their yachts,
their luxury apartments,

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.860
their private jets.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.210
- [Tarini] As he was talking
about these measures,

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:18.745
we saw bipartisan groups of
lawmakers stand up to applaud.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.210
(people clapping)

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.530
- I'm taking robust action

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.380
to make sure the pain of our sanctions

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.890
is targeted at Russian economy

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:28.010
and that we use every tool at our disposal

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:30.400
to protect American
businesses and consumers.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.840
- He announced one new
measure in his speech.

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.390
The US, in addition to 30 other countries,

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:38.210
would be releasing 60
million barrels of oil

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.860
from reserves around the world.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.670
- These steps will help blunt
gas prices here at home.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.550
I want you to know we're going to be okay.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.970
- The president also
spent a significant amount

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.340
of time in his speech
talking about inflation,

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:52.380
which is at a four-decade high.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:56.420
So the president bringing up
boosting domestic production.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.910
- Make more cars and
semiconductors in America.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:03.140
More infrastructure and
innovation in America.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.070
- [Tarini] This was one
of the ways he said the US

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:09.200
could sort of take more control
of the economy coming out

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.033
of the pandemic.

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:13.270
- [Senators] USA, USA.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:16.230
- There's been divisions
related to the pandemic,

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.430
whether it's masking, or vaccinations

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.630
but he tried to bring the country together

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:24.280
and say it was time to sort
of move past all of that.

